  "description": "Unofficial .NET integration for Nerd Fonts (not affiliated with or endorsed by Nerd Fonts). 10,995 icon constants plus the embedded, unmodified Symbols Nerd Font v3.5.1. The font and icons are the work of Nerd Fonts and the upstream icon projects (Codicons, Devicons, Font Awesome, Font Logos, Material Design Icons, Octicons, Seti UI, Pomicons, Powerline, Weather Icons and others) under their own licenses: see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. Only the integration code is MIT. No UI framework dependency.",
